    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Calista Cruise - A Ha Long Bay Spectacle in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with sea views, balconies, and modern amenities. Each room features air-conditioning, a private bathroom, and a work desk. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy an infinity swimming pool, spa facilities, fitness centre, sun terrace, restaurant, and bar.",
      "Additional amenities include a children's playground, yoga classes, and fishing activities. Dining Experience: The romantic restaurant serves lunch and dinner with a buffet breakfast. Live music and evening entertainment enhance the dining experience.",
      "Prime Location: Located 3.8 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 15 km from Sun World Ha Long Park, the cruise provides easy access to local attractions. Cat Bi International Airport is 40 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
