    "address": "Tuan Chau, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Aspira Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with beachfront access, a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, and a fitness centre. Guests enjoy a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas. Comfortable Amenities: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms with walk-in showers.",
      "Additional amenities include minibars, work desks, and free toiletries. The property provides a lounge, public bath, and outdoor fireplace. Dining Options: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, Vietnamese, Asian, and international cuisines.",
      "Breakfast includes local specialities, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. Evening entertainment includes live music and karaoke. Explore Ha Long: Located 42 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is near attractions such as Tuan Chau Harbour (4.1 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (15 km).",
      "Activities include fishing, hiking, and cycling. Guests appreciate the attentive staff and excellent service."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
