    "rating": 9.1,
    "reviewCount": 271,
    "address": "Dock 16c Tuan Chau Maria Island, Halong, Ha Long, Vietnam, Dock 16c Tuan Chau Maria Island, Halong, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Located in Ha Long, Rita Cruise offers 2 days 1 night or up to 3 days 2 nights itinerary with major highlights of the bay including several caves, islands, beaches, and a floating village. The on-site bar comes with a wide selection of drinks. Free WiFi access is available in all areas.",
      "All 36 soundproofed cabins are air-conditioned and come with a seating area with sofa. Every cabin features views from a private balcony. A flat-screen TV, minibar, wardrobe and personal safe are provided.",
      "En suite bathrooms with hot tubs in most of the room are fitted with shower facilities and a hairdryer. Extras include free toiletries, towels and slippers. Meals can be enjoyed at the on-site restaurant at no additional charge with a full board package.",
      "Guests at the cruise will be able to take part in activities in and around Ha Long, like visiting Lan Ha Bay for swimming or kayaking at Ba Trai Dao islet. The cruise will take guests to Viet Hai village where guests can ride a bicycle along the village. Rowing through Sang Toi cave on a bamboo boat is also included.",
      "Guests can engage in Tai Chi session in the early morning and attend free cooking class to learn how to make Vietnamese traditional dishes. Other activities include sunset party, playing card games, squid fishing, and karaoke. Guests can dip in the hot tub or relax with professional massage in the spa center.",
      "A glass of cocktail can be enjoyed next to the swimming pool with beautiful views of Ha Long Bay. Other facilities also include an on-site bar and a shared lounge. Day trips, limousine shuttle bus services and airport transfers can be arranged at a surcharge."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
