    "rating": 10,
    "reviewCount": 6,
    "address": "Bai Chay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Bai Chay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Luna Cruise Luxury Ha Long Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with spa facilities, a swimming pool with stunning views, a sun terrace, and a restaurant. Guests enjoy free WiFi, a bar, and a lounge. Comfortable Amenities: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and modern amenities such as minibars and flat-screen TVs.",
      "Additional facilities include a fitness centre, wellness packages, and a 24-hour front desk. Dining Options: The family-friendly restaurant serves British, French, American, Asian, and European cuisines in traditional, modern, and romantic ambiances. Breakfast options include American, buffet, à la carte, and Asian.",
      "Local Attractions: Located 2 km from Vincom Plaza Ha Long and 6 km from Sun World Ha Long Park, the cruise is also near Quang Ninh Museum (3.5 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (6 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 47 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
