    "address": "Lô 42, cảng Quốc tế Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, Lô 42, cảng Quốc tế Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Catherine Cruises Ha Long Bay is situated in Ha Long, Vietnam, offering easy access to attractions such as Tuan Chau Harbour (4.4 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (15 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 42 km away. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a private beach area, beachfront, infinity swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, water sports, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi.",
      "Additional amenities include a fitness room, hot tub, and kids' club. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms. Amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and soundproofing.",
      "Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all travellers. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, Seafood, Vietnamese, and international cuisines. Breakfast options include local specialities, warm dishes, fresh pastries, and more."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
