    "reviewCount": 635,
    "address": "Got Ferry , Hạ Long, Việt Nam , Ha Long, Vietnam, Got Ferry , Hạ Long, Việt Nam, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Venezia Cruises in Ha Long offers sea views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Each room includes a fireplace, a walk-in shower, and soundproofing for a relaxing stay. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy a sun terrace, bar, and outdoor seating area.",
      "Additional amenities include a lounge, coffee shop, and karaoke. Private check-in and check-out, a 24-hour front desk, and full-day security ensure convenience. Explore the Area: Located a few steps from Ben Beo Harbour and a 19-minute walk to Cannon Fort, the cruise is near Cat Co 2 Beach (2 km), Hospital Cave (9 km), and Cat Ba National Park (13 km).",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 54 km away. Guest Favorites: Guests highly rate the sailing, boating, property staff, and service support. Activities include fishing, pub crawls, walking tours, bike tours, canoeing, and cycling."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
