    "address": "Bãi Cháy Cảng Tàu Khách Quốc Tế Hạ Long, Ha Long, Vietnam, Bãi Cháy Cảng Tàu Khách Quốc Tế Hạ Long, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Arcady Boutique Cruise in Ha Long offers beachfront access with stunning sea views. Tuan Chau Harbour lies 1.9 km away, while Tuan Chau Beach is 2 km nearby. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy spa facilities, a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, balcony, and outdoor furniture. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and sea or mountain views. Amenities include a minibar, soundproofing, and parquet floors.",
      "Dining Experience: The restaurant serves British, seafood, and Vietnamese cuisines with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options. Breakfast is a buffet, while meals include brunch, lunch, and dinner. Activities and Attractions: Guests can enjoy fishing, yoga, fitness classes, walking tours, and bike tours.",
      "Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (13 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
