    "rating": 9.6,
    "reviewCount": 16,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina Terminal Station, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina Terminal Station, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Heritage Line Ylang Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sauna, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy air-conditioning, balconies, bathrobes, private bathrooms, baths, hairdryers, work desks, minibars, showers, slippers, carpeted floors, and wardrobes. Dining Options: The cruise serves French, American, Vietnamese, Asian, and European cuisines, complemented by a pool bar and coffee shop.",
      "Activities and Attractions: Activities include bike tours and cycling. Nearby attractions include Tuan Chau Beach (19-minute walk), Tuan Chau Harbour (1.4 km), and Cat Bi International Airport (41 km). Guest Satisfaction: Highly rated by guests for its excellent service and facilities."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
