    "overview": [
      "Beachfront and Leisure: Sena Cruises - Wonder On Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers a beachfront setting with a sun terrace, spa facilities, and a restaurant. Guests can enjoy sailing, boating, and relax on the sun terrace. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms.",
      "Additional amenities include minibars, free toiletries, and work desks. Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all travellers. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Asian cuisine with brunch, dinner, high tea, and cocktails.",
      "An outdoor seating area and coffee shop provide additional dining options. Nearby Attractions: Located 1.9 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is close to Tuan Chau Beach (2 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
