    "rating": 8.7,
    "reviewCount": 550,
    "address": "Gate 11, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long, Vietnam, Gate 11, Tuan Chau Marina, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Aqua Cruise Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with a private beach area, beachfront, fitness centre, sun terrace, open-air bath, restaurant, massage services, bar, and outdoor swimming pool. Free WiFi is available in public areas. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, fitness room, concierge, meals for kids, outdoor seating, family rooms, full-day security, room service, and karaoke.",
      "Free on-site private parking is provided. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, international, and European cuisines with brunch, lunch, dinner, high tea, and cocktails. Breakfast includes local specialities, juice, fresh pastries, pancakes, cheese, and fruits.",
      "Prime Location: Located 18 minutes from Tuan Chau Beach and 1.3 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is 39 km from Cat Bi International Airport. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car (12 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (12 km)."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
