    "address": "Tuan Chau Whaft, Ha Long, Vietnam, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Whaft, Ha Long, Vietnam, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Set in Ha Long Bay, Alisa Premier Cruise offers contemporary accommodation on board. With the 2 days 1 night or up to 3 days 2 nights itinerary, guests can enjoy major highlights of the bay including several caves, islands, beaches, and a floating village. Free WiFi access is available in all areas.",
      "All 22 soundproofed cabins are air-conditioned and come with a seating area with sofa. A flat-screen TV, minibar, wardrobe and personal safe are provided. En suite bathroom with hot tub in most of the room is fitted with shower facilities and a hairdryer.",
      "Extras include free toiletries, towels and slippers. Guests can enjoy all meals at the on-site restaurant at no additional charge with a full board package. During this cruise, guests will have a chance to explore Sung Sot cave or visit Titov island for swimming and hiking up the mountain.",
      "Guests can also engage in Tai Chi session in the early morning and attend free cooking class to learn how to make Vietnamese traditional dishes. Other activities include squid fishing, kayaking and karaoke. Guests can dip in the hot tub or relax with professional massage in the spa center.",
      "Other facilities also include an on-site bar and a shared lounge. Day trips, limousine shuttle bus services and airport transfers can be arranged at a surcharge."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
