    "address": "Tuan Chau Island, Ha Long City, Quang Ninh, Viet Nam, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Island, Ha Long City, Quang Ninh, Viet Nam, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Embarking from, and ending off the stay at the Ha Long Bay, Paradise Elegance Cruise Halong offers an array of pre-arranged activities, coupled with a stay on-board the cruise ship. Guests can indulge in relaxing massages after an action-packed day at Le Parfum spa, chill with a refreshing cocktail on the sun deck while watching cooking demonstration, or enjoy afternoon tea Le Piano Bar. Free WiFi is available in public areas.",
      "Featuring Vietnamese design, all contemporary air-conditioned cabins are furnished with floor-to-ceiling window and a private balcony/terrace featuring view of the Ha Long Bay. An LCD TV and a personal safe are included. En suite bathroom comes with a standing shower, and free toiletries.",
      "Select units have a bathtub. The cruise has an in-house restaurant, Le Marin, which serves fusion lunch buffet and dinner with à la carte menu."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
