    "address": "Tuan Chau Pier, Ha Long, Quang Ninh, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Pier, Ha Long, Quang Ninh, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Featuring classical design, Cozy Bay Private Cruise offers contemporary accommodation on board. The cruise has a large sun deck and an on-site restaurant. Guests can chill at the 24-hour bar, which serves a selection of refreshing cocktails, spirits and beer.",
      "All units have air conditioning and windows enjoying sea view. En suite bathroom comes with shower facility. The cruise is 15 km from Ha Long city and 25 km from Cat Ba Island.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 30 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
