    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Rosy Cruises in Ha Long offers a private beach area, beachfront, and stunning sea views. Tuan Chau Wharf is 2 km away, while Tuan Chau Harbour lies 2.3 km from the property. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, spa facilities, and free bicycles.",
      "The family-friendly restaurant serves African, American, and Asian cuisines, while the bar provides a relaxing atmosphere. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms, balconies, and modern amenities. Additional services include a 24-hour front desk, concierge, and free on-site parking.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Tuan Chau Beach is 2 km away, while Sun World Ha Long Park lies 13 km from the property. Cat Bi International Airport is 40 km distant."
    ],
