    "address": "Lot 9 Ngoc Chau Harbour - Tuan Chay Ward - Halong City - Quang Ninh province, Ha Long, Vietnam, Lot 9 Ngoc Chau Harbour - Tuan Chay Ward - Halong City - Quang Ninh province, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Sailing down the emerald waters of Halong Bay, Auco Cruiser offers luxurious air-conditioned cabins with free internet and a balcony with views. On-site activities include Vietnamese cooking lessons. All meals are provided.",
      "The modern cabins come with wooden furnishings and flooring. Refillable bottles. is included in all cabins.",
      "The luxurious bathrooms come with a shower or bathtub. Auco Cruiser sets sail from Tuan Chau Port in Halong, and travels through Cat Ba Island, Lan Ha Bay. Round-trip transfers from Hanoi, a 3-hour, 30-minute drive away, can be arranged at an extra charge.",
      "In the mornings, guests can take part in the daily Tai-chi sessions on the sun deck. a hot tub. Foreign currency exchange and water sports equipment rental are also provided.",
      "International and Vietnamese meals are offered at The Dining Room. Free wifi covers public areas only."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
