    "rating": 9.4,
    "reviewCount": 488,
    "address": "Sun International Cruise Port, Ha Long, Vietnam, Sun International Cruise Port, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Housed in a traditional wooden boat, Signature Halong Cruise offers luxurious suites with stunning views of Ha Long Bay, a UNESCO World Heritage Site and Bai Tu Long Bay. It has a rooftop sun terrace and provides free Tai Chi lesson on board. Featuring French-inspired décor, air-conditioned suites come with parquet flooring, a wardrobe, seating area and a flat-screen TV with cable channels.",
      "A safe and minibar are also included. The en suite bathroom is equipped with a bathtub, hairdryer, slippers and free toiletries. Signature Halong Cruise operates a 24-hour front desk that can assist guests with luggage storage.",
      "During the journey along Ha Long Bay, guests can enjoy various activities such as fishing, snorkelling and kayaking at a surcharge. Massage treatments can also be arranged on request. The on-board restaurant serves a delectable spread of Vietnamese and Western cuisine from 07:00 to 21:00.",
      "A variety of drinks and light snacks are offered at the bar. Meals can also be enjoyed in the comfort of guests’ rooms. Signature Halong Cruise takes about 4 hours to reach Cat Ba Island.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 80 km away, while Noi Bai International Airport is approximately 170 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
