    "rating": 9.5,
    "reviewCount": 41,
    "address": "Hon Gai Harbor, Ha Long, Vietnam, Hon Gai Harbor, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Garden Peak Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with beachfront access, a spa, fitness centre, sun terrace, and lush gardens. Guests enjoy sea views, private balconies, and modern amenities including air-conditioning and free WiFi. Dining and Leisure: The family-friendly restaurant serves American and Asian cuisines in traditional and modern settings.",
      "Additional facilities include a bar, outdoor fireplace, and evening entertainment. Complimentary breakfast options include continental, American, and local specialities. Prime Location: Located an 8-minute walk from Bai Chay Beach and 1.1 km from Ha Long Queen Cable Car, the cruise is also near attractions such as Sun World Ha Long Park and Vincom Plaza Ha Long.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 45 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
