    "address": "Tuan Chau island, Halong bay, Quang Ninh province, Vietnam, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau island, Halong bay, Quang Ninh province, Vietnam, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Set in Ha Long, a few steps from Tuan Chau Harbour, Paradise Grand Cruise - Lan Ha Bay offers air-conditioned accommodation and a bar. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service, along with free WiFi. The cruise has family rooms.",
      "This cruise offers totally 39 cabins, each of which ranges from 28 sqm to 35 sqm. The air-conditioned cabins are all decorated with parquet wooden flooring and walk-in closets. Every cabin comes with a private balcony or a terrace and broad windows offering panoramic views.",
      "A Michelin-starred à la carte menu is available at the on-site restaurant. Various activities can be enjoyed on board such as watching movie, enjoying spa treatments or joining yoga classes. Throughout the 1 or 2 nights itineraries, guests will have a chance to paddle through the small islets, visit the caves or go trekking through Cat Ba National Park.",
      "The property also offers a paid airport shuttle service."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
