    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Mon Cheri Cruises in Ha Long offers luxurious 5-star cruise experiences with sea views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room features air-conditioning, free WiFi, and modern amenities. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a fitness centre, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, spa bath, and terrace. Comfort and Convenience: The cruise provides a child-friendly buffet, cooking classes, live music, and a tour desk. Free toiletries, minibar, and soundproofing ensure a comfortable stay.",
      "Prime Location: Located 42 km from Cat Bi International Airport, Mon Cheri Cruises is near attractions such as Tuan Chau Harbour (4.2 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (15 km). Guests appreciate the attentive staff and excellent service."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
