    "rating": 8.9,
    "reviewCount": 454,
    "address": "Hạ Long, Ha Long, Vietnam, Hạ Long, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Halong Arcadia Cruise in Hạ Long offers 5-star comfort with spa facilities, a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Family rooms and cooking classes enhance the guest experience. Dining Experience: The restaurant serves Vietnamese, German, Russian, Asian, and international cuisines, including vegetarian options.",
      "Brunch, lunch, and dinner are available, complemented by a buffet breakfast. Leisure Activities: Guests can enjoy fishing and walking tours, relax on the sun terrace, or participate in karaoke. Additional amenities include a 24-hour front desk, paid shuttle service, and room service.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Ha Long Queen Cable Car is a 13-minute walk away, Sun World Ha Long Park 1.1 km, and Tuan Chau Beach 2 km. Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km from the cruise. Highly rated by guests."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
