    "rating": 8.8,
    "reviewCount": 13,
    "address": "Halora Holdings, 20000 Ha Long, Vietnam, Halora Holdings, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Halora Nova Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Private check-in and check-out services ensure a seamless arrival and departure. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms with walk-in showers.",
      "Additional amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and free toiletries, catering to all comfort needs. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines with vegetarian and vegan options. Dining options include lunch, dinner, high tea, and cocktails in traditional, modern, and romantic ambiances.",
      "Convenient Location: Located 3.3 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 14 km from Sun World Ha Long Park, the cruise is 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Quang Ninh Museum."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
