    "rating": 8.7,
    "reviewCount": 185,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Wharf , Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Wharf, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Being a Hanoi capital based travel company, Halong Fantasea Cruise consists of 3 traditional wooden boats operating daily tours from Hanoi to Halong Bay. These tours are specially designed for international travelers in small groups. Meeting the needs of travelers, Halong Fantase Cruise tours focus on 2 and 3-day tour options exploring beautiful hidden places, far away from the crowds in Ha Long Bay and Lan Ha Bay.",
      "The cruising tour from Halong Bay to Cat Ba Island is also available on request. All of these tours are all-inclusive packages that include round-trip shuttle bus transfers from Hanoi to Ha Long, English speaking tour guide, meals on the tour, comfortable rooms on boat, entrance fees, kayaking, cave visiting, swimming, hiking and other interesting activities on board. With many years of experience in serving international travelers, Halong Fantasea Cruise will bring you unique trips and unforgettable experiences.",
      "For more tour information to other destinations in Vietnam, you can contact Halong Fantasea Cruise Team via inbox."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
