    "rating": 9.7,
    "reviewCount": 10,
    "address": "9 Ngọc Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, 9 Ngọc Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Bhaya Soul - Wellness Inclusive Cruise in Ha Long offers a beachfront setting with Tuan Chau Beach just a 17-minute walk away. Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km from the property. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a year-round outdoor swimming pool, sun terrace, and spa facilities.",
      "The cruise features a bar, massage services, and free WiFi in public areas. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms include sea views, balconies, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms with walk-in showers. Additional amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and soundproofing.",
      "Wellness and Activities: Wellness packages, yoga, and fitness classes are available. Activities include fishing, walking tours, bike tours, and cycling."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
