    "rating": 9.8,
    "reviewCount": 17,
    "address": "Bái Tử Long, Ha Long, Vietnam, Bái Tử Long, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodations: Cycad cruise in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea or mountain views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Each room includes a balcony, bathrobes, and free WiFi. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a private beach area, beachfront, sun terrace, indoor swimming pool, and an outdoor seating area.",
      "Additional amenities include a fitness centre, sauna, and karaoke. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese cuisine with local specialities, vegetarian, gluten-free, and dairy-free options. Breakfast includes warm dishes, juice, and fruits.",
      "Prime Location: Located a 9-minute walk from Bai Chay Beach and near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car (1.1 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (14-minute walk). Cat Bi International Airport is 43 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
