    "rating": 8.5,
    "reviewCount": 88,
    "address": "Cảng tàu du lịch quốc tế Tuần Châu Đảo Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, Cảng tàu du lịch quốc tế Tuần Châu Đảo Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: La Pandora Boutique Cruises in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea or mountain views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Each room includes a kitchen, balcony, and free toiletries. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves lunch and dinner with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Guests can also enjoy meals at the bar or outdoor seating area. Leisure Activities: The cruise features a terrace, outdoor dining area, and fishing and cycling activities. Additional amenities include a coffee shop, karaoke, and cooking classes.",
      "Convenient Location: Located 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is a short walk from Tuan Chau Beach and a few steps from Tuan Chau Harbour. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
