    "rating": 9.3,
    "reviewCount": 259,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Wharf, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Wharf, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Halong Sapphire Cruises offers leisurely cruises and activities along Halong Bay. Featuring classically-elegant accommodation on board, Halong Sapphire Cruises embarks from Tuan Chau Port, just 7 km from Ha Long Night Market. The cruise ship features a sun terrace, bar and an on-board restaurant.",
      "Free WiFi is available. Decorated in red-brown and white, each room comes with elegant interiors, with the welcoming bed decked in white, as a centrepiece. The air-conditioned rooms come fitted with a shower.",
      "Toiletries, towels and a hairdryer are provided. Guests can enjoy activities such as swimming and karaoke during the cruise. Tai Chi lessons and movie nights are also offered.",
      "The nearest airport is Cat Bi International Airport, 30 km from Halong Sapphire Cruises. Guest can also enjoy a complimentary round-trip transfer to/from the property in Hanoi's Old Quarter Area."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
