    "rating": 8.5,
    "reviewCount": 4,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Pier, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Pier, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Sailing along Ha Long Bay, Fantasea Imperial Cruise is a traditional Vietnamese wooden ship featuring air-conditioned cabin rooms with sea views. Chargeable shuttle service from Hanoi to Ha Long Bay, which takes approximately 3.5 hours' drive away, can be requested. Each cosy room is furnished with wooden flooring and a seating area.",
      "Private bathroom includes a heated shower, hairdryer and free toiletries. Recreational activities include swimming and cooking demonstration on board. Guests can enjoy excursions to caves, beaches and floating villages along Ha Long Bay.",
      "Meals are served at the restaurant, which offers Vietnamese and Western cuisine."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
