    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Verdure Lotus Classic Cruise on Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea or mountain views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room includes air-conditioning, a work desk, and free toiletries. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a private beach area, beachfront, swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, and lush garden.",
      "The cruise features a restaurant serving American and Vietnamese cuisines, a bar, and a fitness centre. Convenient Location: Located 3.2 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
