    "rating": 10,
    "reviewCount": 3,
    "address": "38 Thương Cảng, Ha Long, Vietnam, 38 Thương Cảng, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Beachfront and Sun Terrace: Private Sail Ha Long - Bai Tu Long in Ha Long offers a beachfront setting with a sun terrace. Guests can relax by the shore or enjoy the outdoor seating area. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature air-conditioning, balconies, and terraces.",
      "Each room includes a tea and coffee maker, TV, and electric kettle, ensuring a comfortable stay. Dining Options: Breakfast options include continental, American, buffet, Italian, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, halal, gluten-free, and Asian. Fresh pastries, pancakes, cheese, fruits, and juice are available.",
      "Amenities and Services: The cruise provides free WiFi, a bar, and a coffee shop. Additional services include private check-in and check-out, a 24-hour front desk, concierge, room service, and full-day security. Nearby Attractions: Bai Chay Beach is a 7-minute walk away, Ha Long Queen Cable Car less than 1 km, and Sun World Ha Long Park an 11-minute walk.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 43 km from the property."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
