    "address": "Beo Harbor Cat Ba Island, Cat Ba, Vietnam, Beo Harbor Cat Ba Island, Hai Phong Municipality",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Cozy Boutique Cruise in Cat Ba offers family rooms with sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and free WiFi. Each room includes a balcony or terrace, ensuring a pleasant stay. Dining and Leisure: Guests can enjoy a buffet breakfast, brunch, and dinner at the family-friendly restaurant.",
      "The on-board bar serves cocktails in a relaxed setting. Additional facilities include a sun terrace, free bicycles, and a coffee shop. Activities and Surroundings: The cruise provides opportunities for fishing, bike tours, and cycling.",
      "Nearby attractions include Ben Beo Harbour, Cannon Fort, and Cat Co 2 Beach, each within 2 km. Cat Bi International Airport is 54 km away. Highly rated for its excellent service and activities."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
