    "rating": 9.3,
    "reviewCount": 2883,
    "address": "No 19 A, Tuan Chau Wharf, Ha Long, Vietnam, No 19 A, Tuan Chau Wharf, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Genesis Luxury Regal Cruise by Premier Group is situated in Ha Long. The property is set at Tuan Chau Marina, Halong Bay. Guests can enjoy sea views.",
      "All rooms in the cruise are equipped with a flat-screen TV. The rooms feature a wardrobe. A continental breakfast is available every morning at Genesis Luxury Regal Cruise by Premier Group.",
      "At the accommodation you will find a restaurant serving Asian and Vietnamese cuisine. A gluten-free option can also be requested. Genesis Luxury Regal Cruise by Premier Group offers 5-star accommodation with a hot tub and terrace.",
      "The program may be changed slightly due to specific weather or tide conditions without prior notice to visitors. The time in the schedule is approximate only. The specific time will be informed by our tour guide on the day of departure.",
      "All activities included in the program. Guests can completely choose to rest and enjoy the scenery on their own, without fully participating in the above-mentioned activities. Estimated travel time is based on normal traffic conditions.",
      "Departure time and activities have been fixed according to a schedule registered with the Bay Management Board, so you need to be on time. Any delays may result in trip suspension or inability to participate in sightseeing activities. Staff at Genesis Luxury Regal Cruise by Premier Group are always available to provide advice at the reception.",
      "All customers to oblige to Genesis Cruise company standards and regulations and to follow the instructions of Genesis Cruise personnel at all times. Vincom Plaza Ha Long is 20 km from the accommodation, while Queen Cable Car Station is 21 km from the property. Cat Bi International Airport is 69 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
