    "rating": 8,
    "reviewCount": 2,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Pier, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Pier, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Cozy Bay Classic Cruise in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Each room includes a bidet, free toiletries, and a wardrobe. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves seafood, Vietnamese, local, Asian, international, and European cuisines.",
      "Halal, kosher, gluten-free, and dairy-free options are available. Leisure Facilities: Guests can relax on the private beach area, sun terrace, or outdoor seating area. The bar provides a perfect spot for unwinding.",
      "Convenient Location: Located 39 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is an 18-minute walk from Tuan Chau Beach and 1.3 km from Tuan Chau Harbour. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
