    "address": "Tuan Chau harbor, Halong No 20B, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau harbor, Halong No 20B, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Beachfront and Leisure: Halong CAPELLACRUISE in Ha Long offers a beachfront setting with an infinity swimming pool, spa facilities, fitness centre, sun terrace, water sports, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, private bathrooms, and modern amenities. Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all guests.",
      "Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese cuisine with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options. Breakfast includes continental and buffet with juice and fruits. Nearby Attractions: Located 1.6 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, 2.2 km from Tuan Chau Beach, and 12 km from Sun World Ha Long Park.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 38 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
