    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Grand Pioneers Halong Bay Cruise 1 in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with beachfront access, a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sauna, fitness centre, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, minibars, and balconies. Additional features include terraces, pools with views, dining areas, and interconnected rooms.",
      "Dining Options: The modern, family-friendly restaurant serves Chinese, French, American, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, and international cuisines. Breakfast includes continental, American, Italian, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, halal, gluten-free, and kosher options. Activities and Attractions: Activities include fishing, film nights, and walking tours.",
      "Nearby attractions include Tuan Chau Beach (13-minute walk), Tuan Chau Harbour (1.1 km), and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 41 km away."
    ],
