    "address": "Tuan Chau Island, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Island, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Legend Halong Private Cruises provides a relaxing stay in comfortable cabins along Halong Bay. The cruise brings guests from Hanoi to Halong Bay offering a variety of activities like night squid fishing, kayaking, and swimming. Guests can also participate in cooking classes.",
      "The accommodation will provide you with air conditioning and a balcony. Featuring a hairdryer, the bathrooms also come with free toiletries and slippers. You can enjoy a sea view from all the rooms.",
      "Other facilities offered at the property include luggage storage. You can enjoy a selection of Western and Asian food at the Legend Restaurant. Ha Long City is located about 16 km away, while Cat Ba island is situated about 24 km.",
      "If you feel like visiting the surroundings, check out Ha Long Night Market located 7 km away. The boat is 30 km from Cat Bi International Airport."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
