    "rating": 8.6,
    "reviewCount": 128,
    "address": "Halong international port (Sun Group), Ha Long, Vietnam, Halong international port (Sun Group), Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Situated in Ha Long, 600 metres from Tuan Chau Beach, Ambassador Cruise Halong features accommodation with a restaurant, free private parking, a bar and a terrace. This 5-star cruise offers room service. The cruise offers an outdoor swimming pool, evening entertainment and a 24-hour front desk.",
      "At the cruise, each room has a balcony with a sea view. At Ambassador Cruise Halong rooms include a wardrobe, a flat-screen TV and a private bathroom. Guests at the accommodation can enjoy a continental breakfast.",
      "Guests at Ambassador Cruise Halong will be able to enjoy activities in and around Ha Long, like fishing. Tuan Chau Harbour is 1.2 km from the cruise, while Ha Long Queen Cable Car is 13 km from the property. The nearest airport is Cat Bi International, 30 km from Ambassador Cruise Halong, and the property offers a paid airport shuttle service."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
