    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Heritage Line Ginger Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, private bathrooms, bathrobes, and modern amenities such as minibars and flat-screen TVs. Dining Options: The restaurant serves brunch, lunch, and dinner with French, American, Vietnamese, Asian, and European cuisines, including vegetarian and vegan options.",
      "Activities and Location: Located 41 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is a short walk from Tuan Chau Beach and near attractions like Ha Long Queen Cable Car."
    ],
