    "rating": 8.9,
    "reviewCount": 219,
    "address": "Ha Long International Port, Ha Long, Vietnam, Ha Long International Port, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Athena Royal Cruise in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room features a work desk, TV, and free toiletries, ensuring a comfortable stay. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a sauna, sun terrace, and a rooftop pool.",
      "The cruise includes a restaurant, bar, and lounge, providing ample opportunities for relaxation and entertainment. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, buffet, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and Asian breakfasts. Dinner options include brunch, cocktails, and traditional, modern, and romantic ambiances.",
      "Prime Location: Located 45 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is an 8-minute walk from Bai Chay Beach and near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park. Guests appreciate the sailing, boating, and attentive staff."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
