    "reviewCount": 143,
    "address": "Vinashin Wharf, Le Thanh Tong, Hon Gai, Ha Long, Vietnam, Vinashin Wharf, Le Thanh Tong, Hon Gai, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Signature Royal Cruise offers luxurious and elegant accommodation offering stunning views of the UNESCO World Heritage Site, Ha Long Bay and the beautiful Lan Ha Bay. It operates a 24-hour front desk and features an on-board restaurant. Offering spectacular views of the sea, air-conditioned rooms come with parquet flooring, a wardrobe, in-room safe, a flat-screen TV and minibar.",
      "The en suite bathroom includes shower facility, hairdryer and free toiletries. Bathrobes and slippers are also provided. At Signature Royal Cruise, guests can relax at the rooftop sun terrace or enjoy drinks at the bar.",
      "Fluently-conversed in Vietnamese and English, friendly staff can assist with luggage storage and ironing services. Vinashin Wharf is approximately 39 km from Cat Bi International Airport."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
