    "address": "Ha Long International Port ( No 9 Ha Long Street, Bai Chay Ward, Ha Long City, Quang Ninh Province, Vietnam), Ha Long, Vietnam, Ha Long International Port ( No 9 Ha Long Street, Bai Chay Ward, Ha Long City, Quang Ninh Province, Vietnam), Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Halong Athena Cruise in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with beachfront access, a sauna, sun terrace, restaurant, and bar. Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms equipped with walk-in showers and free toiletries. Dining and Leisure: The family-friendly restaurant serves seafood, Vietnamese, and local cuisines in a traditional and modern ambience.",
      "Breakfast includes continental, American, buffet, and Asian options, while dinner features brunch, high tea, and halal, kosher, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free menus. Activities and Location: Located 43 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is an 8-minute walk from Bai Chay Beach and near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car (1.1 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (13-minute walk). Guests enjoy fishing, sailing, boating, and water sports."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
