    "address": "No 22, Port 2, Tuan Chau Wharf, Ha Long, Vietnam, No 22, Port 2, Tuan Chau Wharf, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Indochine Cruise Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with beachfront access, spa facilities, a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy private check-in and check-out, a paid airport shuttle, lounge, outdoor fireplace, wellness packages, hot tub, 24-hour front desk, concierge service, and family rooms. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, Asian, and international cuisines with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Breakfast includes American and Asian selections. Nearby Attractions: Tuan Chau Beach is an 18-minute walk away, Tuan Chau Harbour 1.4 km, and Cat Bi International Airport 41 km. Activities include fishing, bike tours, and cycling."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
