    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: La Casta 5-Star Cruise 2D1N in Ha Long offers beachfront access to Lan Ha Bay. Tuan Chau Beach is an 18-minute walk away, while Tuan Chau Harbour lies 1.3 km from the property. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a year-round outdoor swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, and a traditional restaurant serving Asian cuisine.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, massage services, and a bar. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms. Complimentary WiFi, minibars, and soundproofing ensure a relaxing stay.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car (12 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (12 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
