    "address": "Hạ Long Bay Du thuyền, 200000 Ha Long, Vietnam, Hạ Long Bay Du thuyền, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: New La Casta Star 6-Star Cruise Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room includes air-conditioning, a minibar, and free WiFi. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy a hot spring bath, beachfront, spa facilities, sun terrace, restaurant, massage services, bar, and free WiFi.",
      "Additional amenities include a lounge, wellness packages, and a 24-hour front desk. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves international cuisine with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options. Meals are available as brunch, lunch, and dinner in traditional, modern, and romantic settings.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Located 1.6 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 2.2 km from Tuan Chau Beach, the cruise is also close to Ha Long Queen Cable Car (12 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (12 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 38 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
