    "address": "Gate 35 Tuan Chau Habour Halong bay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Gate 35 Tuan Chau Habour Halong bay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Doris Cruise by HAG in Ha Long offers family rooms with modern amenities. Guests enjoy free WiFi, a sun terrace, and spa facilities. Dining Experience: The onboard restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines.",
      "Meals include brunch, lunch, dinner, high tea, and cocktails, accommodating vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free diets. Leisure Activities: Activities include fishing, hiking, cycling, and water sports. The cruise features a hot tub, lounge, and entertainment staff.",
      "Convenient Location: Located 3.6 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 15 km from Ha Long Queen Cable Car. Cat Bi International Airport is 42 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
