    "address": "No. 12 Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, No. 12 Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodations: Le Journey Elegance Cruise in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea views, air-conditioning, and modern amenities. Each room includes a private bathroom, balcony, and free WiFi. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, and water sports.",
      "Additional amenities include an open-air bath, restaurant, bar, and indoor play area. Dining Experience: The modern restaurant serves British, Indian, Vietnamese, and international cuisines. Breakfast options include continental, American, vegetarian, vegan, halal, and gluten-free.",
      "Prime Location: Located 8 minutes from Tuan Chau Beach and 600 metres from Tuan Chau Harbour. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park. Cat Bi International Airport is 40 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
