    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Boasting a sun terrace, Orchid Classic Cruise offers itinerary cruising along Halong Bay and Lan Ha Bay. Air conditioned rooms feature a private balcony that open up to views. The seating area is fitted with a satellite TV and a minibar.",
      "En suite bathrooms include a bathtub, hairdryer and free toiletries. Extra includes bathrobes and slippers. Guests can approach the 24-hour front desk for massage services at the spa centre.",
      "Alternatively, a fitness centre is available for guests who wish to work out. Hanoi is a 2.5-hour drive from Orchid Classic Cruise. Cat Bi International Airport is 35 km from the property."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
