    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodations: Amanda Luxury Cruise in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea views, balconies, and modern amenities. Each room includes air-conditioning, a private bathroom, and free WiFi. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a private beach area, beachfront, rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, and water sports.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, outdoor fireplace, and electric vehicle charging station. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves British, Indian, American, and Vietnamese cuisines. Breakfast options include continental, American, and local specialities.",
      "Evening entertainment features live music and themed dinner nights. Prime Location: Located 1.8 km from Tuan Chau Beach and a 19-minute walk to Tuan Chau Harbour. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car (14 km) and Cat Bi International Airport (40 km)."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
