    "address": "Ngọc Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, Ngọc Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Paradise Legacy Cruise Halong in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea views, balconies, and modern amenities. Each room includes air-conditioning, a private bathroom, and free toiletries. Dining Experience: The modern restaurant serves international cuisine with halal, kosher, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Guests can enjoy breakfast, lunch, and dinner in a comfortable setting. Leisure Facilities: The cruise features a terrace, hot tub, and bar. Additional amenities include a work desk, dining area, and seating space, ensuring a relaxing and enjoyable stay.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Tuan Chau Beach is an 8-minute walk away, while Tuan Chau Harbour lies 600 metres from the cruise. Other attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (13 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km from the property."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
