    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Halong & Bai Tu Long Cruises in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with spa facilities, a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, balconies, and modern amenities such as minibars and flat-screen TVs. Dining Options: The restaurant serves local cuisine with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Additional facilities include a coffee shop, outdoor seating, and cooking classes. Activities and Attractions: Visitors can engage in fishing, bike tours, and cycling. Nearby attractions include Tuan Chau Beach (3-minute walk), Ha Long Queen Cable Car (less than 1 km), and Sun World Ha Long Park (11-minute walk).",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 38 km away."
    ],
