    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: La Regina Legend Cruise in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea or mountain views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room includes air-conditioning, free WiFi, and modern amenities. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy spa facilities, a fitness centre, sun terrace, and open-air bath.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, sauna, and outdoor fireplace. The property features a restaurant, bar, and lounge. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner with local specialities, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options.",
      "Dining areas include traditional, modern, and romantic ambiances. Activities and Attractions: Activities include fishing, yoga, fitness classes, and snorkelling. Nearby attractions include Tuan Chau Harbour (4.1 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (15 km).",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 42 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
