    "address": "Gate 35, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long, Vietnam, Gate 35, Tuan Chau Marina, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Dora Cruise by HAG is situated in Ha Long, Vietnam, offering beachfront access and proximity to attractions such as Tuan Chau Harbour (4.1 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (15 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 42 km away. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a spa and wellness centre, swimming pool with a view, fitness centre, sun terrace, restaurant, massage services, bar, and free WiFi in public areas.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, 24-hour front desk, and family rooms. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, private bathrooms, bathrobes, and modern amenities. Additional facilities include terraces, patios, work desks, and interconnected rooms, ensuring a comfortable stay.",
      "Dining Experience: The traditional restaurant serves brunch, lunch, dinner, high tea, and cocktails with Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options are available."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
