    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Hermes Cruises in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea views, balconies, and modern amenities. Each room includes air-conditioning, a private bathroom, and free WiFi. Wellness and Leisure: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a wellness centre, and an outdoor swimming pool.",
      "The property features a sun terrace, garden, and open-air bath. Additional amenities include a fitness centre, hot tub, and kids' pool. Dining and Entertainment: The on-board restaurant serves a variety of cuisines, while the bar offers a selection of beverages.",
      "Evening entertainment includes live music and themed dinner nights. Location and Attractions: Located 2 km from Tuan Chau Beach, Hermes Cruises is 38 km from Cat Bi International Airport. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
