    "address": "Block 11A, Terminal 2 , Lot 2, Tuan Chau island, Halong, Quang Ninh, Ha Long, Vietnam, Block 11A, Terminal 2 , Lot 2, Tuan Chau island, Halong, Quang Ninh, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Venus Cruises Halong Bay by Venus Group is situated in Ha Long, Vietnam, offering beachfront access and proximity to Tuan Chau Beach (1.7 km) and Tuan Chau Harbour (18-minute walk). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a swimming pool with stunning views, spa facilities, fitness centre, sun terrace, water sports, and a lush garden.",
      "Free WiFi is available throughout the property. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea or mountain views, balconies, air-conditioning, and modern amenities such as flat-screen TVs and free toiletries. Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all needs.",
      "Dining Experience: The traditional restaurant serves Chinese, British, Indian, American, Vietnamese, and international cuisines, including vegetarian, vegan, and dairy-free options. Additional facilities include a bar, coffee shop, and outdoor seating area. Activities and Services: Guests can enjoy fishing, cycling, and film nights.",
      "The property offers a tour desk, bike hire, and car hire services. Highly rated for its excellent service and attentive staff."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
