    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: La Regina Classic Cruise in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea or mountain views, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Each room includes a tea and coffee maker, free toiletries, and a work desk. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines.",
      "Breakfast options include continental, American, buffet, Italian, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, and Asian. Dinner features brunch, lunch, and dinner with halal, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. Leisure Facilities: Guests can relax on the sun terrace, enjoy the bar, and participate in cooking classes.",
      "The cruise includes a fitness room, lounge, and entertainment staff. Nearby Attractions: Bai Chay Beach is an 8-minute walk away, Ha Long Queen Cable Car 1.1 km, and Sun World Ha Long Park 14-minute walk. Cat Bi International Airport is 45 km from the property."
    ],
