    "rating": 9.4,
    "reviewCount": 72,
    "address": "Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Grand Pioneers Halong Bay Cruise 2 in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with spa facilities, a swimming pool with stunning views, a fitness centre, terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi. Comfortable Amenities: Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, bathrobes, minibars, and soundproofing. Additional features include balconies, saunas, and interconnected rooms.",
      "Dining Options: The family-friendly restaurant serves French, Indian, American, Italian, Vietnamese, and local cuisines. Breakfast includes continental, American, buffet, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, halal, gluten-free, and kosher options. Prime Location: Located 13 minutes from Tuan Chau Beach and 1.2 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is 39 km from Cat Bi International Airport.",
      "Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
