    "rating": 8.7,
    "reviewCount": 63,
    "address": "Halong International Port, Bai Chay ward, 1st floor, Ha Long, Vietnam, Halong International Port, Bai Chay ward, 1st floor, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodations: Ambassador Signature Cruise - Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room includes air-conditioning, free toiletries, and modern amenities. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a sun terrace, and an outdoor seating area.",
      "The property features a restaurant, bar, and wellness packages. Additional services include a 24-hour front desk, room service, and luggage storage. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves lunch and dinner with vegetarian and vegan options.",
      "Breakfast includes continental, buffet, and Asian selections. Evening entertainment and live music enhance the dining experience. Prime Location: Located 45 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is a short walk from Bai Chay Beach and near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park.",
      "Guests appreciate the attentive staff and excellent service."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
