    "rating": 9.5,
    "reviewCount": 92,
    "address": "Tuần Châu N22, port 2, Tuan Chau, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuần Châu N22, port 2, Tuan Chau, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Indochine Premium Halong Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with spa facilities, a swimming pool with stunning views, a sun terrace, and a restaurant. Guests enjoy free WiFi, a bar, and a lounge. Comfortable Amenities: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms with walk-in showers.",
      "Additional amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and soundproofing. The property provides a hot tub, fitness centre, and indoor and outdoor play areas. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, Vietnamese, and Asian cuisines with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options.",
      "Breakfast includes American, buffet, and Asian selections. Dining options include brunch, lunch, and dinner. Activities and Location: Guests can enjoy fishing, sailing, and boating.",
      "The cruise is 38 km from Cat Bi International Airport and near attractions such as Tuan Chau Beach (2.1 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (11 km). Highly rated for excellent service and staff support."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
