    "rating": 9.5,
    "reviewCount": 94,
    "address": "Block No.28A Tuan Chau International Marina Block No.28A Tuan Chau International Marina, Ha Long, Vietnam, Block No.28A Tuan Chau International Marina Block No.28A Tuan Chau International Marina, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Verdure Lotus Grandeur Cruise on Ha Long Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with a private beach area, beachfront, and spa facilities. Guests enjoy a swimming pool with stunning views, sun terrace, and water sports. Comfortable Amenities: The cruise features a wellness centre, hot tub, and open-air bath.",
      "Dining options include a family-friendly restaurant, modern and romantic ambience, and a variety of cuisines. Additional facilities include a bar, coffee shop, and outdoor seating area. Prime Location: Located 1.9 km from Tuan Chau Beach and 1.7 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport.",
      "Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
