    "address": "Halong International Cruise Port, Ha Long, Vietnam, Halong International Cruise Port, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Victory Star Cruise in Ha Long offers beachfront access, situated 43 km from Cat Bi International Airport. Nearby attractions include Bai Chay Beach, an 8-minute walk away, and Sun World Ha Long Park, a 13-minute stroll. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a spa, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas.",
      "Additional amenities include a hot tub, beauty services, wellness packages, and a kids' club. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and modern conveniences such as minibars and flat-screen TVs. Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all travellers.",
      "Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. Breakfast includes continental and buffet selections with fresh pastries and fruits."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
