    "address": "No 19A ,Tuan Chau Wharf, Ha Long, Vietnam, No 19A ,Tuan Chau Wharf, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Majesty Luxury Prime Cruise by Premier Group in Ha Long offers a 5-star experience with a rooftop swimming pool, spa and wellness centre, sun terrace, restaurant, and bar. Guests enjoy sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms equipped with free toiletries. Comfortable Amenities: The cruise features a 24-hour front desk, wellness packages, hot tub, evening entertainment, and live music.",
      "Additional facilities include a coffee shop, family rooms, cooking classes, and karaoke. Dining Options: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, Seafood, Vietnamese, and Asian cuisines with vegetarian and gluten-free options. Breakfast includes continental, buffet, and vegetarian selections.",
      "Prime Location: Located 37 km from Cat Bi International Airport and 1.9 km from Tuan Chau Beach, the cruise is near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
