    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodations: Stellar of the Seas Cruise in Ha Long offers luxurious rooms with sea or mountain views, air-conditioning, balconies, and modern amenities. Each room includes a private bathroom, bathrobes, and free WiFi. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, fitness room, and wellness packages.",
      "The property features a family-friendly restaurant serving American and Asian cuisines, a bar, and live music. Prime Location: Located 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is near Tuan Chau Beach (2.1 km) and Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km). Activities include fishing, cycling, and snorkelling.",
      "Highly rated for its beach trip convenience and attentive staff."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
