    "rating": 6.8,
    "reviewCount": 6,
    "address": "Halong International Cruise port, 9 Halong road, Bai Chay, Halong, Quang Ninh, Halong, Halong, Quang Ninh, Vietnam, 01119, Ha Long, Vietnam, Halong International Cruise port, 9 Halong road, Bai Chay, Halong, Quang Ninh, Halong, Halong, Quang Ninh, Vietnam, 01119, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Starlight Cruise in Halong offers luxurious rooms with air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and modern amenities. Each room features a dining table, work desk, and free WiFi, ensuring a comfortable stay. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese cuisine with vegetarian, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Guests can enjoy lunch and dinner in a traditional or romantic ambience, complemented by a bar for relaxation. Leisure Facilities: The cruise includes a sun terrace, hot tub, and children’s playground. Additional amenities include a lounge, karaoke, and mini golf, providing entertainment for all ages.",
      "Nearby Attractions: Located 1.9 km from Vincom Plaza Ha Long and 49 km from Cat Bi International Airport, Starlight Cruise is close to attractions such as Quang Ninh Museum and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
