    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Ruby Premium Cruise in Ha Long offers air-conditioned rooms with sea views, terraces, balconies, and modern amenities including bathrobes and free toiletries. Each room features a bath, electric kettle, and free WiFi. Dining and Leisure: Guests can enjoy Vietnamese cuisine at the on-board restaurant and unwind at the bar.",
      "Additional facilities include a coffee shop, child-friendly buffet, and a minimarket. Free off-site private parking is available. Convenient Location: Located 2 km from Tuan Chau Beach and 2.5 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is close to attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (13 km).",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
