    "address": "Halong International Cruise Port, 9 Ha Long Street, Bai Chay Ward., Ha Long, Vietnam, Halong International Cruise Port, 9 Ha Long Street, Bai Chay Ward., Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: La Regina Royal Cruise in Ha Long offers spacious rooms with sea or mountain views. Each room features air-conditioning, a private bathroom, and modern amenities. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy a private beach area, spa facilities, sun terrace, water sports, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi.",
      "Additional services include beauty treatments, fitness classes, and a hot tub. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves American, Vietnamese, local, Asian, and barbecue grill cuisines. Breakfast options include continental, American, buffet, Italian, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, and Asian.",
      "Prime Location: Located 2.2 km from Tuan Chau Beach and 13 km from Sun World Ha Long Park, the cruise is 39 km from Cat Bi International Airport. Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Vincom Plaza Ha Long."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
