    "rating": 9.2,
    "reviewCount": 32,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Whaft, Dock No.16, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Whaft, Dock No.16, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Offering a variety of activities including Tai Chi classes on the sundeck, fishing excursions and cooking classes, Alisa Cruise provides accommodation on board. Featuring an on-site restaurant, the property also offers massage services and has free WiFi. All rooms and suites are fitted with a private balcony and offer ocean views.",
      "Certain units include a seating area, flat-screen TV and minibar for your convenience. En suite bathroom is equipped with a bath or shower, hair dryer and free toiletries. All-day dining featuring Western and Vietnamese dishes is available at the Luxury Alisa Restaurant, located on the 2nd floor.",
      "Guests can enjoy drinks at the modern Alisa Sky Bar on the 3rd floor. Airport transfers and shuttle services can be arranged upon request. You will find a 24-hour front desk at the property.",
      "Guests can engage in various activities, such as fishing and canoeing. Ha Long Night Market is 8 km away. The nearest airport is Cat Bi International Airport, 29 km from Alisa Cruise."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
