    "reviewCount": 333,
    "address": "41 Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, 41 Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Velar of the Sea Cruise in Ha Long offers family rooms with sea or mountain views, balconies, and private bathrooms. Each room includes air-conditioning, free toiletries, and a work desk. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy an infinity swimming pool, indoor pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, and water sports.",
      "The cruise features a restaurant, bar, and lounge, alongside yoga classes and fishing. Dining Experience: Breakfast includes local specialities, warm dishes, fresh pastries, and a variety of dietary options. Dining options include seafood, Vietnamese, Asian, and international cuisines.",
      "Convenient Location: Located 2 km from Tuan Chau Harbour and 41 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
