    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina, Block 24, Quang Ninh, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina, Block 24, Quang Ninh, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: La Regina Grand Cruise in Ha Long offers beachfront access, situated 2.1 km from Tuan Chau Beach and 2.3 km from Tuan Chau Harbour. Nearby attractions include Sun World Ha Long Park (13 km) and Cat Bi International Airport (39 km). Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy spa facilities, a sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi.",
      "Additional amenities include a fitness room, outdoor fireplace, and children's playground. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea or mountain views, balconies, air-conditioning, and private bathrooms. Complimentary breakfast options include continental, buffet, vegetarian, and Asian.",
      "Exciting Activities: Activities available include fishing, film nights, and walking tours. The property staff and service support are highly praised by guests."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
