    "rating": 9.1,
    "reviewCount": 102,
    "address": "Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Marina, Ha Long Bay, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Orchid Trendy Cruise offers accommodation with an itinerary cruising the untouched areas of the Lan Ha Bay and Ha Long Bay. Featuring classic architecture, all units are fitted with a satellite flat-screen, minibar and an electric kettle. Some units feature a seating area and/or balcony.",
      "Every unit features a private bathroom with bathrobes and slippers. Bed linen is featured. Orchid Trendy Cruise also includes a spa centre.",
      "Guests can enjoy a meal at the on-site restaurant or a drink at the bar. Transfer between Ha Noi and Ha Long Bay, which takes 2.5 hours in a luxury, shared mini van, is offered a surcharge."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
