    "address": "Tuần Châu, 200000 Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Indochine Grand Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers beachfront access, situated 2 km from Tuan Chau Beach and 2.2 km from Tuan Chau Harbour. Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a rooftop swimming pool, spa facilities, sun terrace, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi.",
      "Additional amenities include a yoga studio, hot tub, and outdoor fireplace. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms with free toiletries. Additional amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and work desks.",
      "Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines, offering lunch and dinner with vegan options. Breakfast includes fresh pastries."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
