    "address": "No5, 6A Le Thanh Tong, Hon Gai, Ha Long, Vietnam, No5, 6A Le Thanh Tong, Hon Gai, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Beachfront and Sun Terrace: Renea Cruises Halong in Ha Long offers a beachfront setting with a sun terrace. Guests can relax by the shore and enjoy sea views. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese cuisine with vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, and dairy-free options.",
      "Breakfast includes continental selections. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature private bathrooms with walk-in showers, air-conditioning, and free toiletries. Additional amenities include sea views, parquet floors, and wardrobes.",
      "Activities and Nearby Attractions: Guests can enjoy sailing, boating, fishing, and film nights. Bai Chay Beach is an 8-minute walk away, while Ha Long Queen Cable Car lies 1.1 km from the property. Cat Bi International Airport is 45 km distant."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
