    "address": "Tuan Chau Wharf, Cat Hai, Cat Ba, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau Wharf, Cat Hai, Cat Ba, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Comfortable Accommodations: Calypso Cruises in Ha Long offers sea views, air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and free WiFi. Each room includes a work desk, minibar, and TV. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy a rooftop swimming pool, sun terrace, and free bicycles.",
      "The romantic restaurant serves Vietnamese and European cuisines with vegetarian, gluten-free, and dairy-free options. Additional amenities include a bar, lounge, and coffee shop. Convenient Location: Located 40 km from Cat Bi International Airport, the cruise is a short walk from Tuan Chau Beach and Harbour.",
      "Nearby attractions include Ha Long Queen Cable Car and Sun World Ha Long Park."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
