    "address": "Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuần Châu, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Prime Location: Heritage Cruises Binh Chuan Cat Ba Archipelago is situated in Tuần Châu, Ha Long, Vietnam. Tuan Chau Beach is a 5-minute walk away, while Tuan Chau Harbour lies just a few steps from the property. Exceptional Facilities: Guests enjoy beachfront access, a swimming pool with stunning views, sauna, fitness centre, sun terrace, and free bicycles.",
      "Additional amenities include a spa, open-air bath, and free WiFi throughout the cruise. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature sea views, air-conditioning, balconies, and private bathrooms. Amenities include bathrobes, minibars, and soundproofing, ensuring a relaxing and comfortable stay.",
      "Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant offers Asian and European cuisines in a modern and romantic ambience. Breakfast is available as a continental buffet, catering to diverse preferences."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
