    "rating": 8.7,
    "reviewCount": 58,
    "address": "Ha Long International Cruise Port, Ha Long, Vietnam, Ha Long International Cruise Port, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Beachfront Location: Victory Cruise in Ha Long offers direct beachfront access with stunning sea views. Guests can relax on the sun terrace or enjoy the outdoor seating area. Comfortable Accommodations: Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and modern amenities.",
      "Family rooms and interconnected rooms cater to all travellers. Dining Experience: The family-friendly restaurant serves Vietnamese, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Breakfast includes continental and buffet options with fresh pastries and fruits.",
      "Leisure Activities: Guests can participate in fishing, yoga, walking tours, canoeing, and hiking. The property also offers spa facilities, beauty services, and a bar. Nearby Attractions: Bai Chay Beach is an 8-minute walk away, while Sun World Ha Long Park is 13 minutes on foot.",
      "Cat Bi International Airport is 43 km from the cruise."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
