    "overview": [
      "Elegant Accommodation: Era Cruise Lan Ha Bay in Ha Long offers a 5-star cruise experience with spacious family rooms and balconies. Each room features sea or mountain views, air-conditioning, and modern amenities. Exceptional Facilities: Guests can enjoy spa facilities, a fitness centre, sun terrace, water sports, restaurant, bar, and free WiFi in public areas.",
      "Additional services include a 24-hour front desk, concierge, and tour desk. Dining Experience: The restaurant serves Vietnamese and international cuisines with vegetarian, vegan, and dairy-free options. Breakfast includes continental, buffet, and fresh pastries.",
      "Prime Location: Located 19 minutes from Tuan Chau Beach and 1.5 km from Tuan Chau Harbour, the cruise is near attractions such as Ha Long Queen Cable Car (13 km) and Sun World Ha Long Park (13 km). Cat Bi International Airport is 39 km away."
    ],
