    "address": "Tuan Chau, Ha Long, Vietnam, Tuan Chau, Quang Ninh",
    "overview": [
      "Rosa Cruise offers itinerary cruising along Ha Long with a variety of activities, including snorkeling, diving, and fishing. Guests can enjoy sea view while relaxing on the sun deck. At the cruise, rooms are equipped with a balcony with view, air conditioning, and a private bathroom.",
      "Rosa Cruise offers a à la carte or American breakfast. At the accommodation you will find a restaurant serving European cuisine. Staff at the cruise are always available to provide advice at the reception.",
      "Ha Long Night Market is 8 km from Rosa Cruise. The nearest airport is Cat Bi International Airport, 30 km from the property."
    ],
    "lifeOnBoard": [
      "A multi-course Vietnamese and international menu featuring fresh sea catch prepared daily by onboard master chefs.",
      "Sunset cocktails on the sundeck, evening squid fishing, cooking demonstrations, and morning Tai Chi classes."
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Private oceanview balcony in every suite",
      "Panoramic sundeck & Jacuzzi pool",
      "Gourmet dining & sunset cocktail bar",
      "Guided kayaking & cave exploration included"
    ],
